stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NoRole
    NoRole --> StartingPoint: add starting point
    NoRole --> Exclusion: add exclusion
    StartingPoint --> Remove: remove point
    StartingPoint --> Conflict: request incompatible role
    Exclusion --> Remove: remove exclusion
    Exclusion --> Conflict: request incompatible role
    Conflict --> Explain: disable action and explain why
    Explain --> StartingPoint
    Remove --> NoRole
